{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Gi1mWTguzC9GvNYHtGPZ8V","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Project State Summary\n\n**Problem**: Classic Unix utilities have no formal specs for implementers. This project derives specs from C source, generates Go implementations via AI (mage-claude-orchestrator), and verifies parity through differential testing against GNU reference binaries.\n\n**Architecture**: Four-stage pipeline (extract → specify → synthesize → verify). Code lives in `cmd/` (one package per utility), `pkg/sys/` (platform syscall abstractions), `pkg/format/` (output formatting), and `pkg/testutils/` (differential testing harness). `magefiles/` and `docs/` are excluded from code generation (DD7).\n\n**Current state**: Source code already exists for `pkg/format/` (align, color, size + tests), `pkg/sys/` (stat, terminal), and `pkg/testutils/` (difftest, runner + tests). No `cmd/` packages exist on the working branch.\n\n**Release 00.0**: Four use cases — uc001-magefiles, uc002-format, uc003-sys, uc004-testutils. Since `pkg/format/`, `pkg/sys/`, and `pkg/testutils/` already have source code, uc002–uc004 are effectively complete. The remaining generation target is `cmd/version/` (the only code target within prd011-magefiles; magefiles/ itself is excluded scaffolding per DD7).\n\n## Priority Reasoning\n\nRelease 00.0 is the earliest incomplete release. The only remaining code generation target is `cmd/version/`, which is the sole `cmd/` deliverable of rel00.0-uc001-magefiles. Per P2, implementation and tests are split into separate tasks; this batch covers implementation only (1 task limit).\n\n```yaml\n- index: 0\n  title: \"Implement cmd/version binary -- prd011-magefiles\"\n  dependency: -1\n  description: |\n    deliverable_type: code\n\n    required_reading:\n      - docs/specs/product-requirements/prd011-magefiles.yaml (all requirements for the version binary)\n      - docs/specs/use-cases/rel00.0-uc001-magefiles.yaml (use case context for magefiles and version)\n      - docs/ARCHITECTURE.yaml (cmd/ component pattern and design decision DD7 on generation scope)\n      - go.mod (module path for imports)\n\n    files:\n      - path: cmd/version/main.go\n        action: create\n        note: Version binary entry point; prints version metadata to stdout and exits 0\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: \"Create cmd/version/main.go implementing all requirements from prd011-magefiles that apply to the cmd/version binary. Read prd011-magefiles.yaml thoroughly and implement every requirement it specifies for version output format, content, and behavior.\"\n      - id: R2\n        text: \"The binary must compile as a standalone executable via go build ./cmd/version/ and print version information to stdout, exiting with code 0 on success.\"\n      - id: R3\n        text: \"Support build-time injection of version metadata via Go ldflags (-X main.varName=value). Define package-level string variables for each metadata field. When ldflags are not provided at build time, use sensible defaults (e.g., 'dev' for version).\"\n      - id: R4\n        text: \"Follow project file conventions observed in existing packages: copyright header (Copyright (c) 2026 Petar Djukic. All rights reserved.), SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT, and an Implements: prd011-magefiles comment.\"\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: \"cmd/version is the sole code generation target within prd011-magefiles. The magefiles/ directory is scaffolded infrastructure excluded from generation per ARCHITECTURE.yaml design decision DD7. Do not create or modify any files under magefiles/.\"\n      - id: D2\n        text: \"Follow the cmd/ package convention established in ARCHITECTURE.yaml: one package per utility under cmd/<name>/ with main.go as the entry point, compiling to a standalone binary.\"\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: \"cmd/version/main.go exists and compiles without errors via go build ./cmd/version/.\"\n      - id: AC2\n        text: \"Running the compiled binary prints version information to stdout and exits with code 0.\"\n      - id: AC3\n        text: \"Package-level string variables for ldflags injection are defined and used in output. When unset, defaults are printed instead.\"\n      - id: AC4\n        text: \"Copyright header (2026 Petar Djukic), SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT, and Implements: prd011-magefiles comment are present.\"\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":43976,"cache_read_input_tokens":19292,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":43976},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a1ac2bb7-d596-45e8-b654-23cf1aa72cb9","uuid":"e5e01ed7-1087-4653-b722-9c0cd902c8e8"}
